<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-10-25T17:08:15.249Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 17:08:15 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Two Philippine Coast Guard bomb experts were wounded in an accidental explosion at their Zamboanga City barracks, while two Coast Guard personnel were killed in a shooting in Cotabato City. The Philippines, United States and Japan completed their 22nd multilateral maritime cooperative activity in the West Philippine Sea, and the Philippine Coast Guard rescued 20 people off Basilan. Taiwan offered cooperation to protect undersea cables and a former NSA urged activation of the Philippines-China coast guard agreement. Chinese militia boats are expanding battlefield preparation in the western Pacific, and there were 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Philstar.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxQSGhsSTI3d2lKQ1NKWklCWU54Q1owTWNES3JHR3BnOGF4cElSYkc0d2hTOWU2eWZZQ3BBbjF4QlFDcENmUklSQ1pFcG50ei1PQTF6czc4LVlEZTFsNVBLN05FcVBhQUd6WmpyV0RsSlJqaWpyVDZkWld5bUJaSHNxR3NwYUFJUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Chronicle PH&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;GMA Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxNSnpkZUpmN0E4dHBqbXQ0NFU4RUtwcVE0dkRFUEdyeUhEeUhBZnlGcS1FWk1uOUhzWFlwS1M2dnc4eXVyVEN0Z2VvNHlmQ1VZVU5aRi1zeUdKWWpla3d3Q1RRX2RDa0libV8wbUQtZmxkU2RMb0xkLVRYSWF3Vk5hYkNiY3FBWEZKWDViSmdYVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;astig.ph&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxOcWJqQ254QTFNNWFGWHJPaTVzUlVQQmpDT0tEUFc0dDdZRGQzaUEybWhhRDJWVTFYYkVWT0RLdE01U1ptTFplR0szeU5mb0wxSkdiRDhwWlVuTXlnaFpGaEtpUjBVeFRlVXQtWWNXeHRlQmluMzBlYWZnTkZPTVdsdTlBRGpTbmx2VmZSQlBhY3p1c1NqM20tZHNlZmhzRVkwS1hXaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;DZR